{"id":2730,"date":"2026-06-11T14:42:17","date_gmt":"2026-06-11T14:42:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2730"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:48:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:48:53","slug":"magic-white-cotton-sandstone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/magic-white-cotton-sandstone\/","title":{"rendered":"Magic White Cotton Sandstone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"673\">Magic White Cotton Sandstone is a premium natural sandstone admired for its beautiful white background, subtle cotton-like textures, and naturally flowing patterns. Its sophisticated appearance and timeless elegance make it a preferred choice among architects, builders, designers, and homeowners seeking premium natural stone solutions.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"1037\">The stone&#8217;s soft color palette complements both contemporary and traditional architectural styles, creating bright, welcoming, and visually appealing spaces. Whether installed as flooring, wall cladding, pathways, courtyards, terraces, garden landscapes, or feature walls, Magic White Cotton Sandstone adds character, warmth, and natural beauty to every project.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1334\">Renowned for its durability and long-lasting performance, the stone is suitable for both interior and exterior applications. Its natural variations, unique veining, and distinctive texture ensure that every installation possesses an exclusive appearance while maintaining a consistent aesthetic.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1553\">Combining elegance, strength, and low maintenance requirements, Magic White Cotton Sandstone remains a popular choice for projects seeking a refined natural stone solution with enduring value and architectural appeal.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4zmfa9\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1576\">Product Attributes<\/h2>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div cla